{"task_id": "Mbpp/69", "solution": "from typing import List, Any\n\ndef is_sublist(main_list: List[Any], sublist: List[Any]) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"\n    Check if sublist appears as contiguous subsequence in main_list.\n\n    Args:\n        main_list: The list to search within\n        sublist: The subsequence to search for\n\n    Returns:\n        True if sublist is contiguous subsequence of main_list, False otherwise\n    \"\"\"\n    if not sublist:\n        return True\n\n    len_main = len(main_list)\n    len_sub = len(sublist)\n\n    if len_sub > len_main:\n        return False\n\n    for i in range(len_main - len_sub + 1):\n        if main_list[i : i + len_sub] == sublist:\n            return True\n            \n    return False"}
