{"task_id": "Mbpp/75", "solution": "def find_tuples(tuple_list, k):\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds tuples where all elements are divisible by k from the given list of tuples.\n    \"\"\"\n\n    def _is_element_divisible(element):\n        \"\"\"Checks if a single element is divisible by k.\"\"\"\n        return element % k == 0\n\n    def _is_tuple_fully_divisible(tuple_data):\n        \"\"\"Checks if all elements in tuple_data are divisible by k.\"\"\"\n        for element in tuple_data:\n            if not _is_element_divisible(element):\n                return False\n        return True\n\n    filtered_tuples = []\n    for tup in tuple_list:\n        if _is_tuple_fully_divisible(tup):\n            filtered_tuples.append(tup)\n\n    return filtered_tuples"}
