{"task_id": "Mbpp/96", "solution": "import math\n\ndef divisor(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculate the number of divisors of a given integer.\n    Counts divisors by iterating up to the square root of n.\n    \"\"\"\n    count = 0\n    for i in range(1, int(math.sqrt(n)) + 1):\n        if n % i == 0:\n            if i * i == n:\n                count += 1\n            else:\n                count += 2\n    return count"}
