{"task_id": "Mbpp/167", "solution": "def next_power_of_2(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Find the smallest power of 2 greater than or equal to n.\n    Raises ValueError if n is negative.\n    \"\"\"\n    if n < 0:\n        raise ValueError(\"Input must be a non-negative integer.\")\n    \n    if n == 0:\n        return 1\n    \n    # For n > 0, compute 2 raised to the power of the bit length of (n-1).\n    # This correctly returns n if n is a power of 2, otherwise the next power of 2.\n    return 1 << (n - 1).bit_length()"}
