{"task_id": "Mbpp/172", "solution": "def count_occurance(input_string: str) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Counts the number of non-overlapping occurrences of the substring 'std'\n    in the given input string.\n    \"\"\"\n    count = 0\n    start_index = 0\n    pattern = 'std'\n    pattern_length = len(pattern)\n\n    while True:\n        # Search for the pattern starting from start_index\n        found_index = input_string.find(pattern, start_index)\n\n        # If the pattern is found\n        if found_index != -1:\n            count += 1\n            # Advance start_index past the found pattern to ensure non-overlapping\n            start_index = found_index + pattern_length\n        else:\n            # Pattern not found, so no more occurrences\n            break\n    return count"}
