{"task_id": "Mbpp/290", "solution": "import sys\nfrom typing import List, Tuple\n\ndef max_length(input_lists: List[List[int]]) -> Tuple[int, List[int]]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Find the list with maximum length in a list of lists.\n    Returns first occurrence in case of ties.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not input_lists:\n        return (0, [])\n\n    max_len = -1\n    longest_list = []\n\n    for sublist in input_lists:\n        current_len = len(sublist)\n        if current_len > max_len:\n            max_len = current_len\n            longest_list = sublist\n            \n    return (max_len, longest_list)"}
