{"task_id": "Mbpp/398", "solution": "from typing import List\n\ndef _extract_digits(number: int) -> List[int]:\n    \"\"\"Converts an integer into a list of its individual digits.\"\"\"\n    return [int(d) for d in str(number)]\n\ndef _sum_all_digits(digit_lists: List[List[int]]) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Computes the total sum of all digits from a list of digit lists.\"\"\"\n    return sum(digit for sublist in digit_lists for digit in sublist)\n\ndef sum_of_digits(numbers: List[int]) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Computes the sum of digits of each number in a given list,\n    then sums all these individual digits together.\n    \"\"\"\n    all_extracted_digits_nested = []\n    for num in numbers:\n        all_extracted_digits_nested.append(_extract_digits(num))\n    \n    total_sum = _sum_all_digits(all_extracted_digits_nested)\n    return total_sum"}
