{"task_id": "Mbpp/410", "solution": "def min_val(input_list: list):\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the minimum numeric value in a heterogeneous list.\n    Filters out non-numeric elements before finding the minimum.\n    \"\"\"\n    def filter_numeric_values(input_list: list) -> list:\n        \"\"\"\n        Filters out non-numeric elements from the input list, returning only integers and floats.\n        \"\"\"\n        numeric_elements = []\n        for item in input_list:\n            if isinstance(item, (int, float)):\n                numeric_elements.append(item)\n        return numeric_elements\n\n    def find_minimum(numeric_list: list) -> (int | float):\n        \"\"\"\n        Finds the minimum value in a list of numeric elements.\n        \"\"\"\n        return min(numeric_list)\n\n    numeric_elements = filter_numeric_values(input_list)\n    return find_minimum(numeric_elements)"}
