{"task_id": "Mbpp/409", "solution": "import math\nfrom typing import List, Tuple, Union\n\ndef min_product_tuple(tuple_list: List[Tuple[Union[int, float], Union[int, float]]]) -> Union[int, float, None]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Find the minimum product from pairs of tuples within a given list.\n    Returns None if the input list is empty.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not tuple_list:\n        return None\n\n    min_prod = math.inf\n    for tpl in tuple_list:\n        product = tpl[0] * tpl[1]\n        if product < min_prod:\n            min_prod = product\n            \n    return min_prod"}
