{"task_id": "Mbpp/415", "solution": "import math\n\ndef max_Product(arr):\n    \"\"\"\n    Find the pair of integers with the highest product from the input array.\n    Initializes max_prod to negative infinity and iterates through all unique pairs.\n    \"\"\"\n    max_prod = -math.inf\n    result_pair = (None, None)\n\n    n = len(arr)\n    for i in range(n):\n        for j in range(i + 1, n):\n            current_prod = arr[i] * arr[j]\n            if current_prod > max_prod:\n                max_prod = current_prod\n                result_pair = (arr[i], arr[j])\n\n    return result_pair"}
