{"task_id": "Mbpp/422", "solution": "def find_Average_Of_Cube(n: int) -> float:\n    \"\"\"Calculate average of cubes for first n natural numbers.\n\n    Args:\n        n: Positive integer representing count of natural numbers\n\n    Returns:\n        Float representing average of cubes\n    \"\"\"\n    # The average of the cubes of the first n natural numbers can be calculated using a direct formula.\n    # The sum of cubes (1^3 + 2^3 + ... + n^3) is (n * (n + 1) / 2)^2.\n    # Dividing this sum by n gives the average, which simplifies to n * (n + 1)^2 / 4.\n    average = n * (n + 1)**2 / 4.0\n    return average"}
