{"task_id": "Mbpp/472", "solution": "def check_Consecutive(numbers_list):\n    \"\"\"\n    Checks if the given list contains numbers that form a consecutive sequence.\n    The list is considered consecutive if its sorted elements have a difference of 1 between adjacent numbers.\n    \"\"\"\n    if len(numbers_list) <= 1:\n        return False\n\n    sorted_list = sorted(numbers_list)\n\n    for i in range(len(sorted_list) - 1):\n        if sorted_list[i+1] - sorted_list[i] != 1:\n            return False\n\n    return True"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/468", "solution": "def max_product(array: list[int]) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the maximum product formed by multiplying numbers of an increasing subsequence.\n    Handles empty arrays, single-element arrays, and calculates products using dynamic programming.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not array:\n        return 0\n\n    if len(array) == 1:\n        return array[0]\n\n    # dp[i] stores the maximum product of an increasing subsequence ending at index i.\n    # Initialize dp with each element itself, as a single element is an increasing subsequence.\n    dp = list(array)\n    max_overall_product = max(dp) # Initialize with the largest single element product.\n\n    for i in range(len(array)):\n        for j in range(i):\n            # If array[i] can extend an increasing subsequence ending at array[j]\n            if array[i] > array[j]:\n                # Calculate the product by extending the subsequence ending at j\n                current_product = dp[j] * array[i]\n                \n                # Update dp[i] if this new product is greater than the current max product\n                # ending at i. Python handles large integers, so no explicit overflow check is needed.\n                if current_product > dp[i]:\n                    dp[i] = current_product\n        \n        # After processing all potential extensions for array[i], update the overall maximum product.\n        if dp[i] > max_overall_product:\n            max_overall_product = dp[i]\n\n    return max_overall_product"}
