{"task_id": "Mbpp/474", "solution": "def replace_char(input_string, target_char, replacement_char):\n    # Replaces all occurrences of a target character with a replacement character in a string.\n    # It constructs a new string by iterating through the input string.\n    modified_string_chars = []\n    for char in input_string:\n        if char == target_char:\n            modified_string_chars.append(replacement_char)\n        else:\n            modified_string_chars.append(char)\n    return \"\".join(modified_string_chars)"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/473", "solution": "def _normalize_tuple(tuple_item: tuple) -> frozenset:\n    \"\"\"Convert tuple to frozenset for order-independent comparison.\"\"\"\n    return frozenset(tuple_item)\n\ndef _find_matches(list1: list, list2: list) -> set:\n    \"\"\"Find matching tuples between two lists.\"\"\"\n    normalized_list2_forms = {_normalize_tuple(t) for t in list2}\n    result_set = set()\n    for t1 in list1:\n        if _normalize_tuple(t1) in normalized_list2_forms:\n            result_set.add(t1)\n    return result_set\n\ndef tuple_intersection(list1: list, list2: list) -> set:\n    \"\"\"Find intersection of tuples with order-independent matching.\"\"\"\n    return _find_matches(list1, list2)"}
