{"task_id": "Mbpp/593", "solution": "def removezero_ip(ip_address):\n    \"\"\"\n    Removes leading zeroes from each octet of an IP address string.\n    Splits the address, converts each part to an integer to strip leading zeroes, then rejoins.\n    \"\"\"\n    octets = ip_address.split('.')\n    processed_octets = []\n    for octet in octets:\n        processed_octets.append(str(int(octet)))\n    return \".\".join(processed_octets)"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/594", "solution": "def diff_even_odd(numbers: list[int]) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the absolute difference between the first even and first odd number in a list.\n    Raises ValueError if either an even or an odd number is not found.\n    \"\"\"\n    first_even = None\n    first_odd = None\n\n    for num in numbers:\n        if first_even is None and num % 2 == 0:\n            first_even = num\n        if first_odd is None and num % 2 != 0:\n            first_odd = num\n        if first_even is not None and first_odd is not None:\n            break\n\n    if first_even is None:\n        raise ValueError(\"No even number found in the list.\")\n    if first_odd is None:\n        raise ValueError(\"No odd number found in the list.\")\n\n    return abs(first_even - first_odd)"}
