{"task_id": "Mbpp/726", "solution": "def multiply_elements(input_tuple: tuple) -> tuple:\n    \"\"\"\n    Takes a tuple of numbers and returns a tuple where each element\n    is the product of consecutive elements from the input.\n    \"\"\"\n    # The output tuple will have length N, where N is len(input_tuple) - 1.\n    # Each element at index i in the output is input_tuple[i] * input_tuple[i+1].\n    return tuple(input_tuple[i] * input_tuple[i+1] for i in range(len(input_tuple) - 1))"}
