{"task_id": "Mbpp/743", "solution": "def rotate_right(lst, positions):\n    \"\"\"\n    Rotates a list to the right by a specified number of positions.\n    Returns a new list with elements moved from the end to the beginning.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not lst:\n        return []\n\n    n = len(lst)\n    effective_positions = positions % n\n\n    # The last `effective_positions` elements\n    rotated_part = lst[-effective_positions:]\n    # The remaining elements\n    unrotated_part = lst[:-effective_positions]\n\n    return rotated_part + unrotated_part"}
