{"task_id": "Mbpp/786", "solution": "def right_insertion(array: list[int], target: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Locates the right insertion point for a specified value in sorted order.\n    Returns the index where the target should be inserted to maintain sorted order,\n    placing it after any existing equal elements.\n    \"\"\"\n    low = 0\n    high = len(array)\n\n    while low < high:\n        mid = low + (high - low) // 2\n        if array[mid] <= target:\n            low = mid + 1\n        else:\n            high = mid\n    return low"}
